    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When capturing a Cinematic Video, use this property to control the amount of blur in the simulated depth of field effect.",
      "ko": "Retrieve the underlying error from the notification’s user information dictionary using the key [`AVCaptureSessionErrorKey`](avcapturesessionerrorkey.md).",
      "sourceHash": "e9ea17528f643802ac22de814cac93982460ef7fd0e28da106feade11d892593",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "This property only takes effect when [`isCinematicVideoCaptureEnabled`](avcapturedeviceinput/iscinematicvideocaptureenabled.md) is set to `true`.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 [`isCinematicVideoCaptureEnabled`](avcapturedeviceinput/iscinematicvideocaptureenabled.md)가 `true`로 설정된 경우에만 적용됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "427264354c73c4587e63fd946f5fa9f2ea6c547ba5483b53ae910114066f726f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: Setting this property to a value less than the `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/minSimulatedAperture` or greater than the `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/maxSimulatedAperture` throws an `NSRangeException`. you may only set this property if `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/minSimulatedAperture` returns a non-zero value, otherwise an `NSInvalidArgumentException` is thrown.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: 이 속성을 `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/minSimulatedAperture`보다 작은 값이나 `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/maxSimulatedAperture`보다 큰 값으로 설정하면 `NSRangeException`이 발생합니다. 이 속성은 `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/minSimulatedAperture`가 0이 아닌 값을 반환하는 경우에만 설정할 수 있으며, 그렇지 않으면 `NSInvalidArgumentException`이 발생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "729340fb3776c4f450414c9789ec2f3280f606928171149e2b3bcc7be6604760",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "You must set this property before starting a Cinematic Video capture.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 Cinematic Video 캡처를 시작하기 전에 설정해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "48bc3ca156b509c4839e2a6a70b7a5d4c300b02e2f06fd60fc2bd95fd850e2ec",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "If you attempt to set it while a recording is in progress, an `NSInvalidArgumentException` is thrown.",
      "ko": "녹화가 진행 중일 때 설정하려고 하면 `NSInvalidArgumentException`이 발생합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "474e81ae1e2103aa614b0dbe4d36259504dcf0329e076bb033388b3746d55a9c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "This property is initialized to the associated `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/defaultSimulatedAperture`.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 연결된 `AVCaptureDevice/activeFormat/defaultSimulatedAperture` 값으로 초기화됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d7b8f180aea4227c652f969b2d489c1e001e3bb107560943325292c7b06a0307",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "This property is key-value observable.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 key-value 관찰이 가능합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "da10f6fb15a1291aedea3de21f0a99a0321c2e86790d0f3fd44477cca7d3c9a7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
